WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:01.701
&gt;&gt; A NEW YORK CITY FAMILY VISITING
RELATIVES IN TURKEY ARE AMONG

00:00:01.701 --> 00:00:05.872
THE VICTIMS OF THIS DEADLY
EARTHQUAKE.

00:00:05.872 --> 00:00:15.281
BARACK FARIQ, HIS WIFE KIMBERLY
AND TWO SONS, 2-YEAR-OLD HANS A,

00:00:15.281 --> 00:00:20.120
1-YEAR-OLD BILAL WERE FOUND.
THEY HAD BEEN STAYING NEAR THE

00:00:20.120 --> 00:00:23.189
EPICENTER OF THE SECOND DEADLY
EARTHQUAKE.

00:00:23.189 --> 00:00:27.527
SO JOINING US NOW TO TELL US
ABOUT HER SISTER,

00:00:27.527 --> 00:00:36.236
BROTHER-IN-LAW, TWO NEPHEWS,
KIMBERLY'S YOUNGER SISTER, SAMBA

00:00:36.236 --> 00:00:37.036
SALAZAR.
THANK YOU.

00:00:37.036 --> 00:00:41.240
WE KNOW IT'S ROUGH.
WHAT DO YOU WANT PEOPLE TO KNOW?

00:00:41.240 --> 00:00:46.613
&gt;&gt; FIRST AND FOREMOST, I WANT
PEOPLE TO KNOW THAT THIS IS A

00:00:46.613 --> 00:00:51.784
BIG PROBLEM RIGHT NOW IN TURKEY
AND IN SYRIA, AND ALTHOUGH I

00:00:51.784 --> 00:00:56.956
LOST MY FAMILY, THERE ARE
CURRENTLY STILL PEOPLE UNDER

00:00:56.956 --> 00:00:59.825
THERE.
THERE ARE CHILDREN.

00:00:59.825 --> 00:01:05.064
THE NUMBER OF THE DEATH TOLL,
IT'S RISING, AND THE ONLY THING

00:01:05.064 --> 00:01:11.137
I THINK THAT WE ASK IS HAVING
THE HELP, THE AWARENESS THAT

00:01:11.137 --> 00:01:17.810
THIS IS STILL HAPPENING, AND
JUST GETTING AS MANY PEOPLE, ALL

00:01:17.810 --> 00:01:22.048
HANDS, ALL HANDS ON DECK.
IT'S SOMETHING THAT WHEN I FOUND

00:01:22.048 --> 00:01:26.452
OUT THAT MY SISTER AND THE REST
OF MY FAMILY WAS MISSING, THERE

00:01:26.452 --> 00:01:31.457
WAS NO RESCUE TEAM.
THIS IS SOMETHING THAT THE

00:01:31.457 --> 00:01:38.565
BUILDING COLLAPSED AND IT WAS
JUST THREE PEOPLE ON SITE AND

00:01:38.565 --> 00:01:43.169
MANPOWER BEING USED JUST FOR ONE
LOCATION BECAUSE AT THAT TIME

00:01:43.169 --> 00:01:48.107
EVERYTHING WAS CHAOTIC.
EVERYONE WAS A PRIORITY.

00:01:48.107 --> 00:01:51.611
SO IT'S REALLY DIFFICULT.
THIS IS REALLY DIFFICULT TO SEE

00:01:51.611 --> 00:01:55.014
THIS.
SO WE'RE ALL VERY BROKEN IN MY

00:01:55.014 --> 00:02:02.121
FAMILY.
AND ME AND MY SISTER, OUR HEARTS

00:02:02.121 --> 00:02:06.926
ARE BROKEN.
&gt;&gt; CAN YOU TELL US ABOUT THEM?

00:02:06.926 --> 00:02:10.597
&gt;&gt; SO MY SISTER WAS SIX YEARS
OLDER THAN ME.

00:02:10.597 --> 00:02:16.202
SHE WAS VERY GRACEFUL.
SHE WAS VERY -- SHE AS VERY

00:02:16.202 --> 00:02:17.971
LOVABLE.
SHE WAS VERY PASSIONATE ABOUT

00:02:17.971 --> 00:02:22.542
EVERYTHING THAT SHE DID AND SHE
CERTAINLY PUT EVERYONE'S NEEDS

00:02:22.542 --> 00:02:25.912
ABOVE HER OWN.
AND MY BROTHER-IN-LAW WAS VERY,

00:02:25.912 --> 00:02:31.584
VERY, VERY HELPFUL IN THE
COMMUNITY.

00:02:31.584 --> 00:02:36.522
HE WAS VERY SELFLESS.
