HE WAS DONATING -- HE WAS VERY

00:02:49.736 --> 00:02:53.706
ACTIVE WITH NON-PROFIT
ORGANIZATIONS.

00:02:53.706 --> 00:02:58.945
WE'RE REALLY BROKEN.
