00:02:58.945 --> 00:03:10.056
YOUR NEPHEWS?
&gt;&gt; MY NEPHEWS.

00:03:10.056 --> 00:03:11.858
SORRY.
&gt;&gt; IT'S OKAY.

00:03:11.858 --> 00:03:15.128
WE SEE THEM.
THEY ARE BEAUTIFUL.

00:03:15.128 --> 00:03:21.267
&gt;&gt; MY FIRST NEPHEW, HIS NAME IS
HAMSA, HE IS 2 YEARS OLD.

00:03:21.267 --> 00:03:26.439
AND MY LITTLE ONE WAS A YEAR
OLD.

00:03:26.439 --> 00:03:30.677
AND THERE ARE NO WORDS I CAN
DESCRIBE HOW MY FAMILY IS

00:03:30.677 --> 00:03:33.746
FEELING, HOW THEY WERE TAKEN
AWAY SO SOON.

00:03:33.746 --> 00:03:40.486
THEY WERE JUST CHILDREN.
AND WE'RE MOURNING.

00:03:40.486 --> 00:03:44.490
WE'RE MOURNING, YOU KNOW.
WE WERE JUST -- WE HAD SO MUCH

00:03:44.490 --> 00:03:49.629
HOPE.
OUR HOPE WAS TO SEE HIM IN

00:03:49.629 --> 00:03:52.999
PROGRAMS AND ENROLL HIM IN
SCHOOL, AND NOW WE DON'T HAVE

00:03:52.999 --> 00:03:57.570
THAT.
WE'VE LOST ALL OUR HOPE.

00:03:57.570 --> 00:03:59.806
WE DON'T HAVE ANYTHING.
MY MOM AND DAD, THEY ARE VERY

00:03:59.806 --> 00:04:05.545
BROKEN.
IT'S LIKE STARTING OVER FROM

00:04:05.545 --> 00:04:10.616
NOTHING.
IT'S REALLY DIFFICULT.

00:04:10.616 --> 00:04:14.353
&gt;&gt; HOW CAN WE HELP YOU?
EVERYONE IS GOING TO HEAR YOUR

00:04:14.353 --> 00:04:22.495
STORY AND BE SO TOUCHED BY IT.
&gt;&gt; THIS IS A HUGE -- AGAIN, THIS

00:04:22.495 --> 00:04:27.100
IS VERY CHAOTIC.
THIS IS A HUGE LOSS THAT WE ARE

00:04:27.100 --> 00:04:32.705
EXPERIENCING IN MY FAMILY.
AND NOT ONLY IF MY FAMILY, THE

00:04:32.705 --> 00:04:36.909
WHOLE COUNTRY IN TURKEY.
MY SISTER AND THE KIDS, THEY

00:04:36.909 --> 00:04:41.547
WERE U.S. AMERICAN CITIZENS.
THEY WERE BORN HERE.

00:04:41.547 --> 00:04:44.817
THEY WERE RAISED HERE.
AND MY PARENTS AND ME, WE HAVE,

00:04:44.817 --> 00:04:49.555
YOU KNOW, ACCEPT AND MADE A HUGE
GREAT SACRIFICE IN UNDERSTANDING

00:04:49.555 --> 00:04:53.960
AND COMING TO TERMS THAT ONCE WE
FOUND OUT WE WERE READY TO GO ON

00:04:53.960 --> 00:04:58.598
THE NEXT FLIGHT TO TURKEY, BUT
WE DIDN'T HAVE THAT OPTION

00:04:58.598 --> 00:05:04.470
BECAUSE THE ROADS WERE CRACKED.
THERE WAS A RISK.

00:05:04.470 --> 00:05:06.706
OUR LIVES WERE AT RISK IF WE
WENT.

00:05:06.706 --> 00:05:09.275
THEY WEREN'T LETTING PEOPLE
INSIDE THE CITY WHERE THE

00:05:09.275 --> 00:05:14.680
