THEY WERE IN KAHRAMANMARAS, A

00:05:14.680 --> 00:05:22.021
TOWN, A SMALL TOWN WHERE ONCE
THE BUILDINGS COLLAPSED, 80 TO

00:05:22.021 --> 00:05:24.356
95% OF THE TOWN WAS COMPLETELY
DEMOLISHED.

00:05:24.356 --> 00:05:29.529
IT WAS VERY DIFFERENT TO JUST
GET A MACHINE IN TO HELP COLLECT

00:05:29.529 --> 00:05:38.070
AND PICK UP THE CEMENT, BIG
BLOCKS OF CEMENT, ROCKS.

00:05:38.070 --> 00:05:43.776
YOU KNOW, SO JUST WE LOST FIVE
FAMILY MEMBERS.

00:05:43.776 --> 00:05:47.580
MY TWO NEPHEWS, MY
BROTHER-IN-LAW, MY SISTER.

00:05:47.580 --> 00:05:50.115
AND MY BROTHER-IN-LAW'S MOTHER
AND HIS DAD.

00:05:50.115 --> 00:05:54.119
SO MY BROTHER-IN-LAW'S FATHER
WAS THE ONLY SURVIVOR.

00:05:54.119 --> 00:05:56.389
&gt;&gt; AND HE JUST HAD OPEN-HEART
SURGERY, YOU SAID?

00:05:56.389 --> 00:06:01.227
&gt;&gt; HE HAD OPEN-HEART SURGERY.
AND HE BASICALLY SAW HIS

00:06:01.227 --> 00:06:05.465
BUILDING COLLAPSE BEFORE HIS OWN
EYES AND HE COULDN'T DO ANYTHING

00:06:05.465 --> 00:06:17.076
AND HE CALLED MY MOM AND HE
SAID, MOM, HE SAID, BARAK,

00:06:17.076 --> 00:06:21.614
MADELEINE, HAMSA, THEY ARE GONE.
THEY LEFT.

00:06:21.614 --> 00:06:29.522
AND SO HE SPENT OVER 12 HOURS
DIGGING AND JUST FINDING PEOPLE

00:06:29.522 --> 00:06:35.561
TO HELP HIM DIG BECAUSE THE
MACHINES WEREN'T ABLE TO GO IN.

00:06:35.561 --> 00:06:41.367
&gt;&gt; WELL, LISTEN, WE ARE -- THERE
AREN'T WORDS.

00:06:41.367 --> 00:06:45.404
AND WE KNOW THAT THIS IS TOUGH
FOR YOU, AND THERE ARE MANY

00:06:45.404 --> 00:06:47.874
