AND SO WE ARE ALL THINKING ABOUT

00:06:50.343 --> 00:06:52.345
YOU AND OUR THOUGHTS AND PRAYERS
ARE WITH YOU.

00:06:52.345 --> 00:06:54.446
WE REALLY APPRECIATE YOU COMING
IN.

00:06:54.446 --> 00:06:58.684
WE KNOW THIS ISN'T EASY TO DO.
THANK YOU FOR YOUR STRENGTH AND

00:06:58.684 --> 00:07:02.955
